      "content": "thanks for that. but i'm a bit worried about the wording you used in the draft. calling certain viewpoints \"unfounded\" or \"conspiracy theories\" might make the parents feel like they aren't being heard or that their concerns are being dismissed as crazy. if they feel attacked, the meeting might just turn into a shouting match. wouldn't it be better to present their arguments on the same level as the scientific side so we can actually have a productive conversation instead of just telling them they're wrong?",
